WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid, you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:26.000
Hanasakeru Seishonen

00:01:38.420 --> 00:01:39.480
Duck!

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:51.990
Lee-Leng, are you alright?!

00:01:56.870 --> 00:01:58.170
Lee-Leng!

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:03.880
What is this?!
 No!

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:06.390
Lee-Leng! 
 Don't die!

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:12.800
No!

00:02:12.990 --> 00:02:16.140
Lee-Leng!

00:02:16.430 --> 00:02:18.780
Open your eyes!
 Lee-Leng!

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:25.920
No! No! 
 Don't leave me!

00:02:27.770 --> 00:02:32.700
Within the Circle of Destiny

00:02:34.260 --> 00:02:38.170
New York

00:02:47.170 --> 00:02:52.040
I should have stopped Master Kajika from going.

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:55.860
I trust in my instincts!

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:59.300
My heart is racing, telling me to hurry!

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:02.650
But I couldn't stop her.

00:03:03.380 --> 00:03:08.030
I even empathized with her strong feelings for Raginei.

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:10.930
Lee-Leng is with her.

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:16.030
- He won't let Kajika be harmed. 
 - But...

00:03:16.310 --> 00:03:20.040
...if they get caught up in the battle.

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:26.470
Anyway, the ports and airports are going to be closed until martial law is dissolved.

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:30.970
So, there's nothing we can do but sit here?

00:03:31.220 --> 00:03:35.010
It's been three days since I've heard from him.

00:03:35.460 --> 00:03:39.880
Toranosuke. The circle of destiny has turned.

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:44.340
It's something that man can't control.

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:50.170
Kajika willfully chose to dive into it.

00:03:50.810 --> 00:03:52.530
I can only trust her to do the right thing now.

00:03:57.720 --> 00:04:03.070
It'll be up to Kajika, whether she'll be crushed by her destiny or not.

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:09.540
The fate of the country will depend on how things unfold now.

00:04:14.950 --> 00:04:20.380
Raginei

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:27.090
- Clear? - Everything seems good here. Our shift is almost over. - Yea. Let's go back.

00:04:27.570 --> 00:04:29.860
- Let's go out for a drink later. 
 - Sounds good.

00:04:36.970 --> 00:04:42.510
- It's burning! Sergeant, mix it! 
- Yes, ma'm!

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:47.800
-Oh, it's hot!
- Are you alright?!

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:52.320
- Let me see! 
- I'm --- alright.

00:04:53.150 --> 00:04:55.030
What's that odd smell?!

00:04:56.430 --> 00:05:01.780
- She said she's going to make a special soup for Lee-Leng.
- Special soup?

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:05.380
Hey, Isaac! 
I'm almost done.

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:08.950
- You made us some, too? 
- It'll give you energy!

00:05:18.310 --> 00:05:22.810
Alright, I just need to boil it now. 
 In the meantime, I'm going to wash clothes.

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:26.910
- I'll help you!
- Instead of helping me, take your clothes off.

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:30.040
- Hey! That shirt is dirty!
- Wait!

00:05:30.450 --> 00:05:32.550
I'm going to wash it all at once!

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:35.420
- Oh, time to go to work. 
- Yes.

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:37.420
(arguing in the background)

00:05:40.170 --> 00:05:42.620
She's becoming more comfortable here.

00:05:43.350 --> 00:05:47.780
We're comforted by her. It really helps having a girl around here.

00:05:48.420 --> 00:05:53.420
She reminds me--- of the good old days.

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:59.980
I might be the only one that feels like this, but, not only her appearance...

00:06:01.990 --> 00:06:05.620
...but her voice and demeanor, they're alike.

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:09.280
Just like His Highness Rumaty before he took asylum.

00:06:10.900 --> 00:06:15.680
His Highness is already 16 years old, but we remember him...

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:18.960
...as a young boy.

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:22.660
Every morning, when exchanging the guards...

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:26.000
...His Highness used to greet me.

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:30.430
The previous king was still alive too.

00:06:31.860 --> 00:06:36.170
It was like a dream. 
 It's only been two years since then.

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:45.080
- Goslen. Once things are broken, you can't fix them.
- Lieutenant.

00:06:46.770 --> 00:06:51.040
But it's possible for us to make something better!

00:06:54.860 --> 00:07:00.280
Trust that we'll be able to one day. 
If you don't believe, nothing will happen.

00:07:02.890 --> 00:07:05.600
- Yes, sir.
- Lieutenant!

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:09.480
They're reporting on the TV that Captain Sabaji has been executed!

00:07:11.650 --> 00:07:16.330
- Is that so.
- Without a trial?! I can't believe them!

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:19.260
King Somand is out of control!

00:07:20.320 --> 00:07:24.200
<i>No. King Somand is not commanding this.</i>

00:07:24.900 --> 00:07:26.880
<i>My guess is that it's done by Quinza.</i>

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:29.900
<i>What has driven you to that extreme?!</i>

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:36.050
The perpetrator of the coup d'état at Samarta Airport...

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:40.640
...Captain Sabaji and 12 other men have all been executed.

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:45.000
- What's wrong? You seem ill.
-Oh, it's nothing.

00:07:45.670 --> 00:07:50.130
- I'm alright. I have to go now.
- Be safe now.

00:07:55.290 --> 00:08:01.150
<i>Is my brother commanding this?</i>
 <i>Those who get in the way will be eliminated.</i>

00:08:02.490 --> 00:08:05.800
<i>That kind of rule won't last long!</i>

00:08:13.890 --> 00:08:16.280
Lee-Leng, what are you doing?!

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:20.420
- I have to get up, or my body is going to tense up.
- No, you can't move yet.

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:25.140
- Hurry up, and lay back down.
- The doctor said it wasn't critical.

00:08:25.430 --> 00:08:30.650
But you have to take it easy. 
 What if your wounds open up?

00:08:30.870 --> 00:08:34.730
- Take your medicine after your meal too. 
- Meal?

00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:41.890
Two of the red ones. 
 Take the antibiotics every six hours.

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:44.570
Oh, and some water...

00:08:46.510 --> 00:08:49.670
...there's no more. 
 I'll get you some later.

00:08:50.910 --> 00:08:53.620
That's a big t-shirt.

00:08:54.250 --> 00:09:00.080
The sergeant bought it for me, but he didn't know my size.

00:09:00.590 --> 00:09:05.050
Lieutenant Noei has taken care of us well, but we can't stay here long.

00:09:07.950 --> 00:09:10.080
But I can't go anywhere like this.

00:09:10.690 --> 00:09:15.280
If we ask the American Embassy for help, our location will be revealed.

00:09:18.020 --> 00:09:21.580
We can't go out until martial law is dissolved.

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:27.410
- I wonder if Mustafa is OK. 
- He's fine. He can take care of himself.

00:09:27.730 --> 00:09:32.830
Carl and the others must be worried. 
 We can't call them or anything.

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:37.540
- If they haven't found our bodies, they'll know we're alive. 
- You're right.

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:44.300
You're right. Oh, the soup is going to get cold. I'll feed it to you.

00:09:45.120 --> 00:09:50.280
- Stop it! I can eat it myself.
- Here, open up!

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:55.350
- Do I really have to eat this? 
- If you don't eat, you won't heal up.

00:09:55.700 --> 00:09:57.350
Open your mouth!

00:10:01.430 --> 00:10:06.690
<i>It's so bad, I know everyone is worried about me, but...</i>

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:12.100
<i>...I'm enjoying myself here, alone with Lee-Leng.</i>

00:10:12.810 --> 00:10:16.950
<i>I keep on wishing Mustafa would be here too.</i>

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:20.390
<i>I realized...</i>

00:10:22.550 --> 00:10:25.480
<i>...the joy that I felt--- always, always...</i>

00:10:25.800 --> 00:10:29.910
<i>...came from the days that I spent with Mustafa and Lee-Leng.</i>

00:10:32.140 --> 00:10:37.140
<i>I remember praying for a storm, since I didn't want Lee-Leng to go home.</i>

00:10:38.510 --> 00:10:42.590
<i>I knew that I shouldn't be praying for things like that.</i>

00:10:43.610 --> 00:10:46.570
<i>But I didn't want to be apart from him.</i>

00:10:47.940 --> 00:10:52.270
<i>I'm reminded of the time I did that.</i>

00:10:53.580 --> 00:10:55.140
Checkmate.

00:10:57.050 --> 00:11:00.910
This is my 15th win. What are you going to give me this time?

00:11:05.210 --> 00:11:11.100
- You're so inconsiderate! Why can't you lose for me sometime?!
- If I do that, it won't be fun for you.

00:11:13.070 --> 00:11:19.030
- What do you want?
- I want to get five or six suits and shirts.

00:11:19.600 --> 00:11:23.140
If you can, I want you to get a tailor from Milan.

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:28.840
It's probably not possible, so I'll be content with a tailor from Raginei.

00:11:29.320 --> 00:11:33.970
- You're a captive! How many brand name suits do you need?!  
- And also...

00:11:34.220 --> 00:11:36.450
...get me some shoes please.

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:41.140
- Eugene, do you understand the position that you're in?
- Excuse me...

00:11:41.770 --> 00:11:45.410
...I've never worn store-made clothes before. I feel uncomfortable.

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:52.070
I've never experienced wearing the same things twice either.

00:11:53.720 --> 00:11:57.030
Alright, I'll keep my promise.

00:11:57.450 --> 00:12:01.360
- Raisa, call the tailor after you're done cleaning.
- Yes, ma'm.

00:12:02.610 --> 00:12:05.950
I'm warning you. It's useless trying to seduce the tailor.

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:11.240
Also, just in case, the maid that's with you...

00:12:11.650 --> 00:12:15.480
- ...Raisa. It's useless trying to seduce her.
- Why is that?

00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:21.780
Europe's number one playboy doesn't realize it? She hates guys.

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:28.150
- That's why she's serving you.
- Oh, no wonder.

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:34.330
You're so stupid! You tried to seduce her, didn't you.

00:12:36.370 --> 00:12:38.250
I'm tired of playing chess.

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:44.460
Raisa, I didn't know you were like that.

00:12:45.130 --> 00:12:48.990
Everyone makes things up!

00:12:49.880 --> 00:12:55.200
I'm just a little timid around men, that's all.

00:12:56.700 --> 00:12:58.230
I don't know how to say it.

00:12:59.350 --> 00:13:03.930
I'm just not used to--- the graphic stuff.

00:13:05.390 --> 00:13:08.260
- That's all!
- I understand.

00:13:09.090 --> 00:13:11.570
You just don't like dirty men.

00:13:12.650 --> 00:13:17.560
- Am I dirty?
- No! Master Eugene, you're not like that.

00:13:18.260 --> 00:13:19.790
<i>That's what I thought.</i>

00:13:20.970 --> 00:13:24.950
<i>Girls like you love me.</i>

00:13:26.770 --> 00:13:29.600
<i>Acting like a doll that won't permeate the smell of humans.</i>

00:13:30.560 --> 00:13:33.200
<i>That's what I'm good at.</i>

00:13:34.510 --> 00:13:36.610
<i>I'll hold you and kiss you gently.</i>

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:41.350
<i>Now, it's checkmate.</i>

00:13:44.190 --> 00:13:47.500
Challenging you is too easy.

00:13:48.710 --> 00:13:50.370
Your Highness Najayra.

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:56.640
Hanasakeru Seishonen

00:14:00.720 --> 00:14:05.090
American Embassy

00:14:23.310 --> 00:14:25.470
Ambassador! What happened to Kajika?!

00:14:26.140 --> 00:14:28.470
- I'm not sure.
- Is that so.

00:14:31.330 --> 00:14:36.590
But I know they're alive for sure. They weren't among the dead.

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:40.280
Why didn't I go after Kajika?

00:14:41.590 --> 00:14:43.020
It's so shameful.

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:46.430
Don't blame yourself.

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:50.030
It was chaos out there. There was nothing you could do.

00:14:55.030 --> 00:14:58.160
- Kajika! 
- Let me go! I have to get her!

00:15:01.310 --> 00:15:04.690
He went, even with bullets flying in the air.

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:07.810
Did I lose at that point?

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:13.290
No! 
 Did I not show enough affection?!

00:15:14.270 --> 00:15:16.180
I can change from here on out!

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:20.070
If Kajika would love me.

00:15:21.150 --> 00:15:23.220
Please, Kajika, stay alive!

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:25.140
Carl!

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:28.990
Don't be taken aback just by a coup d'état.

00:15:30.170 --> 00:15:34.440
- Father?!
- Sorry for the interruption, ambassador.

00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:40.380
Don't worry. It's an honor to have the leader of the Rosenthals here.

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:44.660
I have some things to discuss with my son.

00:15:45.140 --> 00:15:47.560
Can you leave us for a few minutes?

00:15:47.820 --> 00:15:50.360
Sure, excuse me.

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:54.150
<i>I just can't get to liking him.</i>

00:15:58.930 --> 00:16:04.830
- What is it? - I just got a message from Raginei that Master Lee-Leng and Master Kajika are safe.

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:09.190
The two are under the care of Lieutenant Noei.

00:16:09.760 --> 00:16:14.510
Master Lee-Leng got hurt, though the injury wasn't critical.

00:16:15.150 --> 00:16:18.940
- Is that so.
- I'm going to Raginei as soon as possible!

00:16:19.320 --> 00:16:22.660
I don't care how I get there.

00:16:23.240 --> 00:16:26.300
- Can you give us a moment?
- Yes, sir.

00:16:31.490 --> 00:16:36.200
Toranosuke. How many years has it been since you've been Kajika's bodyguard?

00:16:36.620 --> 00:16:40.310
- Three years. 
- You're a great bodyguard.

00:16:40.730 --> 00:16:42.540
Faithful and loyal.

00:16:43.210 --> 00:16:45.850
You've become just like Kajika's friend.

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:55.240
You'll be able to enter Raginei by using the connections that I have.

00:16:55.670 --> 00:16:57.830
But, before that, I have something to show you.

00:17:01.110 --> 00:17:04.520
- Come on, follow me.
- Yes, sir!

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:20.540
- Enter here.
- Yes, sir.

00:17:21.910 --> 00:17:23.980
Is this a dummy door?

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:37.970
A portrait of His Highness Rumaty?

00:17:38.640 --> 00:17:40.640
No, that's not Rumaty.

00:17:41.690 --> 00:17:43.540
The 73rd King.

00:17:43.990 --> 00:17:46.920
It's a portrait of Machaty, when he was 15.

00:17:48.220 --> 00:17:50.960
This is His Highness Rumaty's grandfather?

00:17:51.660 --> 00:17:56.190
He's deep within the temple, and he's called the "Throne of God."

00:17:56.980 --> 00:17:59.530
It looks exactly like His Highness Rumaty.

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:04.120
This person was...

00:18:04.880 --> 00:18:09.790
...a virtuous ruler called "The Father of Raginei," right?

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:14.250
If he's still alive, he must know the current condition of Raginei.

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:16.610
Why doesn't he say anything?

00:18:16.830 --> 00:18:20.620
Being the Throne of God is equivalent to being God.

00:18:21.320 --> 00:18:23.420
God just presides over everything.

00:18:26.390 --> 00:18:29.760
Your Majesty, Mr. Burnsworth is here.

00:18:30.300 --> 00:18:34.130
He wanted to notify you about winning the bid for the mine and to thank you for it.

00:18:36.390 --> 00:18:40.690
- Come forward.
- You may go forth.

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:45.690
His Majesty has approved of speaking with you directly.

00:18:52.120 --> 00:18:55.530
- What is your name?
- My name?

00:18:56.810 --> 00:18:59.230
My first name is Harry.

00:18:59.900 --> 00:19:02.730
- My mother named me.
- Harry.

00:19:04.390 --> 00:19:05.600
That's a great name.

00:19:07.640 --> 00:19:09.830
A very wonderful name.

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:14.930
The "Throne of God" only observes this earth and its events.

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:20.790
There is no use if the country disappears!

00:19:21.240 --> 00:19:25.320
That's their religion and culture.

00:19:25.950 --> 00:19:28.690
It's nothing that we can measure and judge.

00:19:31.300 --> 00:19:34.810
What is justice? What is prosperity?

00:19:35.830 --> 00:19:40.380
That's decided by each of the countries individually.

00:19:42.290 --> 00:19:45.730
A country that can't find a ruler that is worthy will go to ruins.

00:19:46.590 --> 00:19:51.340
That same fate follows those who don't admit to their own decay.

00:19:54.110 --> 00:19:58.410
I believe Machaty's silence is a sign of trust in the revival for the country.

00:20:00.640 --> 00:20:05.050
If that doesn't happen, he'll let the country fall apart.

00:20:05.510 --> 00:20:09.820
I'm a human myself, so I can't agree with that.

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:15.450
But why is there a portrait of His Majesty Machaty's Throne of God here?

00:20:16.600 --> 00:20:20.490
His Majesty Machaty's "Throne of God" is just like His Highness Rumaty.

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:25.040
And who else is like Rumaty?

00:20:25.360 --> 00:20:27.430
Um, His Highness Rumaty?

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:31.920
Master Kajika is kind of like him.

00:20:34.690 --> 00:20:38.170
Father, I didn't know you were going to come to Raginei.

00:20:39.660 --> 00:20:44.350
Carl, I'm here to take Raginei back from Burnsworth.

00:20:45.110 --> 00:20:48.870
What's the point of taking this country now?

00:20:49.120 --> 00:20:52.880
- I was able to get some dirt on him. 
- <i>He's obsessed.</i>

00:20:53.620 --> 00:20:57.370
<i>His pride was shattered by him.</i>

00:20:57.600 --> 00:20:59.700
<i>Revenge against Harry Burnsworth.</i>

00:21:00.460 --> 00:21:02.090
<i>That's all he's thinking about.</i>

00:21:03.300 --> 00:21:09.000
Is this the destiny that a man once so influential in the business and political arena chooses?

00:21:12.220 --> 00:21:16.390
I'm going to meet with Quinza Hafez tomorrow morning.

00:21:16.650 --> 00:21:18.840
- You have to come.
- Quinza?

00:21:19.830 --> 00:21:23.180
- What are you going to discuss with him?!
- This.

00:21:29.290 --> 00:21:32.570
Sareha, the master of the chamberlain, is Quinza's puppet.

00:21:33.500 --> 00:21:37.670
It could be said that Quinza is behind all the agendas.

00:21:38.630 --> 00:21:40.980
That's why he's not cutting ties with Burnsworth.

00:21:41.910 --> 00:21:44.140
Dossier on Harry Burnsworth?

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:47.860
<i>Hasn't he learned his lesson?</i>

00:21:48.980 --> 00:21:53.440
If he reads that he'll cut ties with Burnsworth.

00:21:53.820 --> 00:21:57.670
No, he might even come up with another plan.

00:21:58.020 --> 00:21:59.240
What do you mean?

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:04.460
It's Quinza's intention to keep this puppet government.

00:22:04.780 --> 00:22:09.080
He wouldn't want Machaty's bastard child showing up, does he?

00:22:11.050 --> 00:22:14.020
- What?!
- Did you not hear me?

00:22:14.910 --> 00:22:16.820
Harry Burnsworth is...

00:22:17.520 --> 00:22:20.900
..the former King Machaty's illegitimate child.

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:23.160
Therefore...

00:22:23.950 --> 00:22:25.960
...he is the King of Raginei.

00:22:32.300 --> 00:22:34.850
So, Master Kajika is...

00:22:35.230 --> 00:22:39.910
His daughter is first in line to succeed the throne.

00:22:41.350 --> 00:22:43.450
It makes her "Her Majesty."

00:22:50.270 --> 00:22:51.320
Kajika is...

00:22:54.630 --> 00:22:56.160
...to succeed the throne?!

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:23.730
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
